<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR slips to 13.19pct from 13.21pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR slips to 13.19pct from 13.21pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATHENS, Oct 1 Reuter) - The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month edged down to 13.19 from 13.21 percent on Wednesday and the bid rate (Athibid) decreased to 12.69 from 12.71 percent.</p>
