<p> Sept 30  13.21   13.16   13.14   13.16   13.27   13.38</p>
<p> Sept 27  13.10   13.02   13.02   13.12   13.26   13.38</p>
<p> Sept 26  12.95   12.95   12.97   13.13   13.26   13.39</p>
<p> Sept 25  12.92   12.93   12.97   13.17   13.26   13.39</p>
<p> Sept 24  12.80   12.83   12.85   12.97   13.12   13.22</p>
