<p> Sept 23  12.32   12.37   12.40   12.49   12.61   12.75</p>
<p> Sept 20  12.64   12.64   12.66   12.74   12.88   13.03</p>
<p>Note: ATHIBOR is Greece's official reference rate. It comprises 13 leading state and private banks committed to quoting their rates by 0900 GMT every day.</p>
